        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-[20px] tracking-[-0.01em] mt-8 mb-3">TikTok Spark Ads</h3>
        <p class="text-ink-2 leading-[1.65] mb-4"><a href="/spark-ads" class="text-accent hover:underline">Spark Ads</a> are TikTok's native branded content format. They allow brands to boost existing creator posts (or brand-account posts) as paid ads while retaining all organic engagement. The creator generates an authorization code, which the brand uses to promote the post through TikTok Ads Manager. Spark Ads appear in the For You feed alongside organic content and consistently outperform standard in-feed ads in engagement rate and CPM efficiency. They are the most popular branded content ad format globally.</p>

        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-[20px] tracking-[-0.01em] mt-8 mb-3">Meta Partnership Ads</h3>
        <p class="text-ink-2 leading-[1.65] mb-4"><a href="/partnership-ads" class="text-accent hover:underline">Partnership Ads</a> (formerly Branded Content Ads) are Meta's equivalent. Creators publish content on Instagram or Facebook and tag the brand as a paid partner. The brand can then promote the post through its Ads Manager with full targeting capabilities. Meta's strength is its targeting infrastructure &mdash; lookalike audiences, retargeting pixels, detailed demographic and interest targeting make it the platform of choice for brands with established first-party data. Partnership Ads on Instagram Reels have become a particularly strong format for direct response campaigns.</p>

        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-[20px] tracking-[-0.01em] mt-8 mb-3">YouTube branded content</h3>
        <p class="text-ink-2 leading-[1.65] mb-4">YouTube's branded content ecosystem is more fragmented than TikTok or Meta. BrandConnect matches brands with creators for sponsored integrations. Creator-made content can also be used as standard YouTube ad creative (in-stream, Shorts, discovery). YouTube's unique advantage is intent: users search for products, reviews, and tutorials. A branded content ad that appears as a relevant video in search results or before related content captures users in an active consideration mindset, which drives stronger brand lift and purchase intent compared to passive feed formats.</p>
