          { q: "How are branded content ads different from influencer marketing?", a: "In traditional influencer marketing, a creator posts about a brand on their own account and the brand pays for the organic reach of that post. In branded content ads, the creator's content is amplified as a paid advertisement with targeting, budget control, and optimization. The brand controls who sees the ad, not just the creator's existing audience. Branded content ads combine the authenticity of influencer content with the precision of paid media." },
